  "description": "Factories return pure create, edit, branch, settle, adopt and shelve transitions; a rename is its own transition. An edit may also restate the summary and the document references of the variant it lands on, in the same write, and is refused on a historical or shelved variant as a content edit is. A branch copies the document references of the variant it comes from (ADR 0054). The write boundary executes the chosen transition against the board read under lease.",
